rem Arranged Probability
rem https://projecteuler.net/problem=100
rem Blue discs for the first total above
rem a limit with chance 1/2 of two blue

use io
use cli

option Limit integer = 1000000000000

rem 2 b (b - 1) = n (n - 1) is a Pell
rem equation: each solution (b, n) maps
rem linearly to the next one.
Blue = 3
All = 4
for All at most Limit
  Next = 3 * Blue + 2 * All - 2
  All = 4 * Blue + 3 * All - 3
  Blue = Next
end
Answer = Blue
Answer print
